s=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your senses, focus on the targets around you and get them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POWER PUNCH</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel superhuman strength as you smash the massive orbs to pieces with your hands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the video to get an idea of how to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game instructions are shown at the beginning of each game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimised for Meta Rift or Quest 2 via Airlink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does it run on your system? Have a look at the demo.</p>","developers":["Hobbyist Game Dev #208012"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1559870/b8914df65205ef55c018a7d718222a500f58d4f5/header.jpg?t=1765304495","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<strong>LIFE-CYCLE</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">The life-cycle of the game includes the phases download, install and uninstall. As soon as the life-cycle starts, you automatically agree to the End User License Agreement (EULA). As soon as the life-cycle ends, your agreement to the End User License Agreement (EULA) is canceled.</ul>","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1559870/1103486658/92d7863c973d3ea3f892757e9d5544e9a6b30818/1765296705/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765304492","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1559870/1103486658/92d7863c973d3ea3f892757e9d5544e9a6b30818/1765296705/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765304492","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1559870/1103486658/92d7863c973d3ea3f892757e9d5544e9a6b30818/1765296705/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765304492","id":257245875,"name":"ORBTRAIN","thumbnail":"https: